  "question": {
    "text": "A battery of internal resistance <math><mn>4</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> is connected to the network of resistances, as shown in the figure. In order to deliver the maximum power&nbsp;to the network, what should be the value of R in ohm?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/gjlksdhgos.PNG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 124px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The given figure is a balanced form of Wheatstone bridge therefore, 6R resistance can be removed.<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />The power delivered to the network is maximum when internal resistance = External resistance.<br /><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
